  "details": "<p>The association of Halicyae with Salemi (BAtlas and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.zotero.org/groups/pleiades/items/itemKey/U2CF7U8D/q/manni\" target=\"_self\" title=\"\">Manni 1981</a>) is not stated in the <em>BTCGI</em>\u00a0which labels Halicyae as a \"non-identified site\".</p>",
